{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13205200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13205200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1320520001:1":{"text":"Thank you all for finding my sheep and bringing back Sasha.","source_cn":"好心的孩子，谢谢你们帮我找回这些羊，还有萨莎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x562706C53DD65011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320520002:1":{"text":"You're welcome, but it was thanks to Sasha that we were able to find the last sheep.","source_cn":"不用谢！都是多亏了萨莎，我们才能找回这只老羊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1034513C9273A06D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320520003:1":{"text":"Yes, Sasha is so brave and smart! I think she even understood us when we were talking.","source_cn":"是呀，萨莎又勇敢又聪明，似乎还能听懂我们说话呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD404D97C1229B435","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320520004:1":{"text":"She understood you...?","source_cn":"能听懂你们说话……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DCB5F6C36631442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320520005:1":{"text":"Yes, we said that the bell on the sheep was missing, and Sasha ran and found it for us!","source_cn":"是啊，我们刚发现绵羊身上的铃铛消失了，萨莎就找到了掉在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB919AF17411D7B86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320520006:1":{"text":"Also, she understood when Hammie was praising her.","source_cn":"更重要的是……它似乎能听懂满满在夸它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F3FB6E6A746AB29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320520007:1":{"text":"*Woof*","source_cn":"汪汪！<key:dialog31>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAFCA941089521F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320520008:1":{"text":"Sasha is such a good girl! Look, everyone is complimenting you!","source_cn":"哎呀，萨莎真是个好孩子，大家都在夸你呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C3E07E9FEAC148E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320520009:1":{"text":"To be honest, she's always helped me with everything, like picking my cane or finding the bell. Maybe she trained herself...","source_cn":"说实话，萨莎经常帮我做这种小事，就像是拿一下拐杖、捡个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC068DE2263C87478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320520010:1":{"text":"Thanks to her, my work's been much easier to handle. Otherwise, herding these sheep would take me forever.","source_cn":"也是多亏了有它在，放牧的工作轻松了不少呢！要不然，光是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5C821C26A5B4EE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320520011:1":{"text":"I sometimes regret that she doesn't have a normal life. She's never allowed herself to be a puppy. She's been helping me since she was young.","source_cn":"就是可惜，萨莎每天都要陪我放牧，没办法让它像其他小狗那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72ECBCBACD684A4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320520012:1":{"text":"I don't think she minds. To her, being with her owner every day is the greatest joy a dog could have.","source_cn":"才不是这样呢！能每天都陪在主人身边，这才是萨莎最大的幸福！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78BD5A3CCB42EED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320520013:1":{"text":"That's right! Chippy thinks so too!\nSasha, you think so too, right?","source_cn":"没错，满满也是这样想的！\\n萨莎，你说对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F1E06236DCEAAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320520014:1":{"text":"*Woof*","source_cn":"——汪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE44661C88E66BB15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:牧民雅科夫":{"text":"Shepherd Yakov","source":"牧民雅科夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨莎":{"text":"Sasha","source":"萨莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":4}}